WEBVTT

00:01.180 --> 00:04.860
I'm seriously super excited! 
We're going skiing today!

00:05.110 --> 00:09.740
<i>That's Hokkaido for you. We get to 
spend a full day of class skiing.</i>

00:09.740 --> 00:12.490
Have you ever gone skiing, Tsubasa?

00:12.490 --> 00:15.240
Not even once. I'm really scared.

00:15.240 --> 00:20.050
Aww, weally? Is wittle Tsuba-chan 
afwaid of skiing? There, there.

00:20.050 --> 00:22.250
Cut it out, Fuyuki-san!

00:22.250 --> 00:26.420
Oh? But teasing you is so much fun, Tsubasa!

00:26.420 --> 00:30.800
I've been skiing since elementary 
school so I'm awesome at it.

00:31.030 --> 00:34.560
Your eyes are gonna pop out of your 
head when you see me shredding gnar!

00:34.760 --> 00:37.560
Shredding... nard?

00:34.800 --> 00:37.550
<b>Shredding nard?</b>

00:37.560 --> 00:41.190
But I think everyone here 
is already pretty good.

00:41.190 --> 00:44.730
I'm not surprised people from 
Hokkaido know how to handle snow.

00:45.160 --> 00:49.210
But it almost never snows in Tokyo. 
Even when it does, it doesn't stick.

00:54.210 --> 00:57.220
Hey, hey. Are you excited 
to go skiing, Sayuri-chan?

01:02.720 --> 01:06.550
Y-Yeah, I guess it goes without saying.

01:08.960 --> 01:12.340
<i>Fuyuki-san gets along with 
everybody. This isn't like her.</i>

01:13.040 --> 01:15.430
<i>I wonder if something happened between them.</i>

01:16.060 --> 01:17.700
Fuyuki-san, you okay?

01:17.700 --> 01:20.640
Huh? Yeah, well... listen.

01:20.960 --> 01:24.420
I'm desperate to become 
friends with Sayuri-chan.

01:24.420 --> 01:26.770
I'm sure we'd become awesome galfriends.

01:27.050 --> 01:29.610
Oh, so it's not like you're 
fighting or anything?

01:29.610 --> 01:33.550
Of course we ain't! I totes like her!

01:33.970 --> 01:37.150
But she gets like this 
whenever I talk to her.

01:37.150 --> 01:41.300
And you still want to become friends, huh? 
You sure are determined.

01:41.300 --> 01:43.670
But I mean, take a good look, Tsubasa.

01:44.180 --> 01:48.510
Isn't she super adorbable? 
Her hair, her style, the way she moves!

01:48.510 --> 01:50.270
And her face, her face, her face!

01:50.270 --> 01:51.560
A classic beauty!

01:51.560 --> 01:55.050
But a dark-haired, prim and 
proper gyaru? Oh my god!

01:57.460 --> 02:00.600
<i>Dark-haired, prim and proper... and a gyaru?</i>

02:00.950 --> 02:03.640
<i>Those things are supposed 
to be complete opposites!</i>

02:04.050 --> 02:07.030
<i>Can such a contradiction truly exist?</i>

02:10.940 --> 02:12.760
You're totally spellbound.

02:12.760 --> 02:15.110
Huh? No, I didn't mean to...

02:15.110 --> 02:17.680
Oh? Fine, whatevs.

02:17.680 --> 02:20.040
We're almost there anyway. Peace out.

02:20.040 --> 02:21.830
Wait! Fuyuki-san!

02:40.180 --> 02:42.850
<b>Hokkaido Gals Are Super Adorable!</b>

02:43.690 --> 02:47.060
<b>Hokkaido Gals Are Super Adorable!</b>

03:55.220 --> 03:58.000
Super Cute Angels ♥

03:55.220 --> 03:58.000
<b>Hokkaido Gals Are</b>

03:55.220 --> 03:58.000
<b>Boom!</b>

03:55.220 --> 03:58.000
<b>Super Adorable</b>

03:58.920 --> 04:02.590
<b>Episode 3:
Akino-san Is Super Unfriendly</b>

03:58.920 --> 04:02.590
<b>Episode 3:
Akino-san Is Super Unfriendly</b>

04:05.910 --> 04:06.920
All right!

04:06.920 --> 04:10.360
Split up into classes A, B, 
and C according to skill,

04:10.360 --> 04:14.090
and follow the instructions 
from the teacher in your class.

04:14.090 --> 04:15.530
Okay!

04:15.870 --> 04:19.030
<i>Um, so where should I go?</i>

04:19.890 --> 04:22.270
Shiki, you don't have any 
skiing experience, right?

04:22.270 --> 04:23.280
Uh, right.

04:23.490 --> 04:28.370
Class C is taking the lift up 
a ways and skiing back down.

04:28.370 --> 04:29.660
Think you can handle that?

04:31.000 --> 04:34.620
I think I should go somewhere 
flat and practice walking first.

04:34.620 --> 04:35.970
That figures.

04:35.970 --> 04:41.800
All right, then. Go with her and we'll 
call it a special beginner class.

04:42.200 --> 04:44.860
It sounds like Akino can't ski at all, either.

04:45.260 --> 04:48.960
I'm also in charge of class C, 
so I can't always keep an eye on you,

04:48.960 --> 04:50.970
but I'll check in every once in a while.

04:54.210 --> 04:56.220
Just don't take any risks, okay?

04:56.220 --> 04:57.150
All right.

05:03.000 --> 05:05.770
<i>This is my best chance to talk to her!</i>

05:05.770 --> 05:08.660
<i>Maybe I can smooth things over 
between her and Fuyuki-san.</i>

05:10.580 --> 05:14.340
Uh, Akino-san? Do you want to go together?

05:16.760 --> 05:18.510
<i>Oh, earbuds?</i>

05:18.910 --> 05:23.530
<i>If she's wearing earbuds, 
she must not want to be bothered.</i>

05:24.030 --> 05:27.620
<i>I feel bad for Fuyuki-san, 
but I'd better not push it, then.</i>

05:28.450 --> 05:33.270
<i>Also, the way she puts her hair 
behind her ears is kinda wild!</i>

05:34.110 --> 05:36.730
<i>I have no idea why I feel that way, though.</i>

05:52.530 --> 05:53.700
<i>Oh, so that's it.</i>

05:53.700 --> 05:56.950
<i>It's easier to move forward if you 
shift your weight from leg to leg.</i>

05:59.300 --> 06:00.630
Akino-san!

06:00.880 --> 06:05.550
Are you okay? I was trying to focus 
and didn't see you. I'm sorry!

06:07.970 --> 06:11.370
What even is the point of learning this?

06:11.750 --> 06:13.350
Tsubasa!

06:16.720 --> 06:18.050
Wow!

06:23.030 --> 06:26.280
Yeah? Yeah? Pretty cool, right?

06:26.280 --> 06:29.740
Wow! What? That was awesome!

06:30.770 --> 06:32.580
What did I tell ya?

06:32.580 --> 06:33.950
Fuyuki!

06:34.460 --> 06:37.220
I told you to stay off the jumps!

06:37.220 --> 06:40.070
Oh, crap. See ya!

06:43.010 --> 06:44.810
She's so cool.

06:45.400 --> 06:47.050
So, Shiki,

06:47.390 --> 06:49.270
are you going out with Fuyuki?

06:49.270 --> 06:50.060
Huh?!

06:50.330 --> 06:52.630
No, no, no! It isn't like that!

06:52.630 --> 06:53.510
Why?

06:53.510 --> 06:56.210
You two were real friendly on the bus, too.

06:56.210 --> 07:00.070
Well, that was just her teasing me, you know?

07:00.070 --> 07:02.130
It seemed like more than that to me.

07:03.210 --> 07:07.140
I warned you at the start! 
What happens if you get injured?

07:07.140 --> 07:10.740
That Fuyuki. 
She's the perfect popular girl, isn't she?

07:07.400 --> 07:07.990
I know.

07:08.410 --> 07:09.620


07:09.620 --> 07:10.740


07:10.740 --> 07:15.210
She's really loud, she's a party girl, 
she's outgoing, and she's a gyaru!

07:16.080 --> 07:19.710
<i>What's that? I think I'm 
sensing a powerful loner aura.</i>

07:19.710 --> 07:22.600
She has everything that I don't.

07:24.160 --> 07:25.340
Akino-san...

07:25.340 --> 07:27.490
Okay, enough chitchat.

07:28.120 --> 07:30.220
Back to independent study.

07:44.870 --> 07:46.400
Want me to ski down with you?

07:46.400 --> 07:46.990
Huh?

07:47.590 --> 07:50.390
The expert course is really gnarly.

07:50.390 --> 07:51.910
I'll escort you down.

07:51.910 --> 07:53.870
Is that okay?

07:53.870 --> 07:57.920
Oh, yes! I'm the snowy mountain rescue gyaru!

07:58.310 --> 07:59.330
Okay.

07:59.590 --> 08:01.250
Yes, please.

08:01.250 --> 08:03.550
All right. 'Kay, ready?

08:03.550 --> 08:04.400
Yeah!

08:09.720 --> 08:11.720
Go, go!

08:13.730 --> 08:16.900
I'm really sorry, Akino and Shiki!

08:16.900 --> 08:20.580
I had my hands full with 
class C and couldn't come to help.

08:21.480 --> 08:25.980
That's all right. By the way, 
what time does lunch break start?

08:25.980 --> 08:31.490
Well, actually... most of the other 
students are already taking their break.

08:32.960 --> 08:34.930
<i>He definitely forgot about us.</i>

08:35.240 --> 08:40.550
But of course, you two can 
take your lunch break now.

08:40.550 --> 08:41.820
Oh.

08:49.430 --> 08:53.140
<i>It would be weird to be 
alone in here with Akino-san</i>

08:53.140 --> 08:55.460
<i>so I think I'll eat my bento inside.</i>

09:01.030 --> 09:04.060
<i>Everyone else is already done with lunch.</i>

09:07.260 --> 09:10.410
Oh, no! My chopsticks are still in my bag!

09:10.990 --> 09:15.070
<i>Wow, stupid me! I'll jump 
in to grab them real quick.</i>

09:25.750 --> 09:28.970
You know, I wonder which ski 
class Sayuri-chan is in.

09:35.220 --> 09:36.430
My bad!

09:36.960 --> 09:39.710
<i>Oh, crap! She was changing?!</i>

09:39.710 --> 09:42.920
<i>She probably thought it was safe 
'cause no one else was on the bus!</i>

09:42.920 --> 09:45.720
<i>Now what? Now what?! I've seen too much!</i>

09:45.720 --> 09:47.970
<i>Her skin and her underwear and her sweat?!</i>

09:47.970 --> 09:51.110
<i>I've got to calm down! 
I've got to explain myself!</i>

09:51.110 --> 09:53.610
Akino-san, I'm very sorry!

09:53.610 --> 09:56.450
I didn't know what you were doing 
and really didn't mean to look!

09:56.450 --> 09:59.570
Of course I won't tell anyone! 
I promise I'll forget what I saw!

09:59.570 --> 10:00.380
It's just...

10:00.380 --> 10:04.710
I accidentally left my chopsticks in 
my bag and I came back to get them.

10:04.710 --> 10:09.080
If it's okay with you, I'll grab 
them and leave. Is that okay?

10:13.510 --> 10:15.270
Of course not.

10:15.270 --> 10:17.320
Sorry. I'll come back later.

10:18.890 --> 10:19.800
Huh?

10:25.620 --> 10:28.950
I should explain. I can do it while we eat.

10:39.720 --> 10:42.580
<i>She's hasn't said a word 
since we sat down to eat.</i>

10:43.270 --> 10:45.150
<i>What did she want to talk about?</i>

10:46.150 --> 10:48.690
<i>Is she going to threaten 
me to keep my mouth shut?</i>

10:49.240 --> 10:52.760
<i>I don't really know what Akino-san is 
like, but I'm kinda getting scared.</i>

10:59.980 --> 11:01.720
I'll make it quick, so listen up.

11:01.960 --> 11:03.410
O-Okay.

11:06.110 --> 11:08.580
I sweat a lot.

11:09.150 --> 11:13.740
I've always been embarrassed about 
sweating, so I always sat out of sports.

11:13.950 --> 11:17.290
But then, after a while, 
I started falling behind.

11:17.290 --> 11:20.080
There were a lot of things I 
didn't learn how to do right.

11:20.440 --> 11:25.460
I started to lose confidence, and before 
I knew it, I was avoiding everyone.

11:25.460 --> 11:27.460
Sometimes I'd think 
"this is getting really bad,"

11:28.060 --> 11:31.170
so I'd put in more effort, 
like with ski practice today.

11:31.170 --> 11:35.090
But then you catch me trying 
to dry off? This is the worst.

11:35.910 --> 11:38.500
I'm really, really sorry about that.

11:38.500 --> 11:41.620
No, it's my fault for being so careless.

11:42.400 --> 11:45.100
But why did you decide to tell me?

11:45.100 --> 11:48.150
I just transferred, and you and I 
have never really talked before.

11:48.680 --> 11:50.280
And about something so personal?

11:51.440 --> 11:53.700
That actually makes it easier.

11:54.200 --> 11:58.860
You didn't know anything about me before, 
so in a way it's easier to talk to you.

11:58.860 --> 12:01.220
Oh. I see what you mean.

12:01.220 --> 12:04.310
And look, we're kind of 
in the same situation.

12:05.080 --> 12:06.250
Even our seats.

12:06.250 --> 12:10.210
The girl with no friends and the lonely 
transfer student right next to each other.

12:10.810 --> 12:14.380
Yeah, things are kind of a mess, but this 
makes me glad that I'm a transfer student.

12:15.070 --> 12:17.960
Also, you're stupidly uptight, Shiki.

12:17.960 --> 12:20.300
Wha—?! Am I really?

12:20.680 --> 12:24.960
What I mean is, I doubt you'll spread 
this around to make fun of me.

12:28.750 --> 12:32.390
<i>Did that sound come from 
inside Akino-san's bag?</i>

12:32.390 --> 12:34.200
<i>A phone notification maybe?</i>

12:34.720 --> 12:36.320
<i>It looks like it's really bothering her.</i>

12:39.380 --> 12:41.720
Don't worry about me. 
You can look if you need to.

12:41.720 --> 12:43.990
What? No, I...

12:45.300 --> 12:49.620
Oh, well. There's no reason 
to hide it at this point.

12:52.200 --> 12:54.610
Yeah, it was the update notification.

12:56.380 --> 12:58.490
<i>The hair behind the ear...</i>

12:59.640 --> 13:01.530
What is that? A tablet?

13:01.530 --> 13:06.390
I got back into this recently. 
I play <i>Sis-Plus SP</i> on the Shueido Witch.

13:06.390 --> 13:07.850
Sis... plus?

13:08.850 --> 13:11.020
Crash Sisters Plus, obviously!

13:08.850 --> 13:14.560
<b>Superb Crash Sisters+</b>

13:11.020 --> 13:13.550
It's a fighting game with 
all kinds of famous characters.

13:13.550 --> 13:14.560
You have to know it.

13:14.560 --> 13:16.990
Actually, no, I don't.

13:16.990 --> 13:19.150
I don't play a lot of games.

13:19.420 --> 13:20.400
Huh?!

13:20.400 --> 13:21.110
Eek!

13:21.320 --> 13:22.780
Give it a shot.

13:22.780 --> 13:27.110
I-I don't know what to do! 
Huh? Where? What do I push?

13:27.110 --> 13:29.000
Start by moving the sticks.

13:32.980 --> 13:34.540
Uh, I lost.

13:36.240 --> 13:39.300
You're so funny! 
You really never played it before.

13:39.540 --> 13:41.780
But I don't know what to do!

13:41.780 --> 13:45.010
Okay, listen. Go like this with 
the stick to move the character,

13:45.010 --> 13:48.350
get closer to the opponent and then attack.

13:48.680 --> 13:51.320
To attack, use this button or this button.

13:51.320 --> 13:54.730
Then block or jump to 
avoid the enemy's attacks.

13:55.080 --> 13:55.770
Oh...

13:57.290 --> 13:57.770
Sorry.

14:02.220 --> 14:04.720
I know how dumb I sound 
when I go off like that.

14:04.720 --> 14:06.450
No way! I didn't think so at all!

14:07.380 --> 14:10.780
You know, I want to get along with people

14:10.780 --> 14:14.540
so I put a lot of thought into my looks, 
but this is what I'm really like.

14:14.890 --> 14:18.550
People always get scared or creeped out 
before I figure out how close is too close.

14:19.550 --> 14:23.670
Then I end up running and hiding in 
the one thing I'm good at. Games.

14:24.560 --> 14:26.150
I'm so pathetic.

14:26.150 --> 14:27.890
No you aren't!

14:27.890 --> 14:30.530
I think it's great that 
you're trying so hard!

14:30.530 --> 14:35.150
I think both your personality and 
looks are really unique and great!

14:35.150 --> 14:37.480
I'm so glad I got to know you!

14:38.560 --> 14:40.220
Thanks for talking to me!

14:44.930 --> 14:47.360
How can you say such embarrassing things?

14:47.360 --> 14:49.910
And you're even good at 
games! That's awesome!

14:50.310 --> 14:53.120
If you don't mind, would you 
teach me more about games?

14:53.390 --> 14:55.850
I want to game with you, Akino-san!

15:03.550 --> 15:06.080
I-I guess I don't have a choice.

15:06.080 --> 15:08.390
Okay, I can teach you, 
but you have to call me Professor.

15:08.870 --> 15:10.510
Yes, Professor!

15:17.070 --> 15:21.600
Wow! What the heck was that? Insane!

15:21.600 --> 15:23.170
How did you do that, Professor?

15:23.760 --> 15:26.740
The moves themselves aren't really that hard.

15:26.980 --> 15:28.990
I'm sure you'll figure it 
out if you just try, Shiki.

15:29.620 --> 15:32.620
<i>If I just try?</i>

15:32.870 --> 15:34.020
All right!

15:45.130 --> 15:48.200
I beat him! I cleared the level, Professor!

15:48.200 --> 15:51.350
Yeah, the weakest CPU in the game.

15:51.350 --> 15:52.850
But you haven't cleared anything yet.

15:52.850 --> 15:55.480
Huh? But it feels like a huge achievement!

15:55.680 --> 15:59.720
Oh, what?! Akino-san, I just 
noticed the time! We gotta go!

15:59.720 --> 16:02.330
Huh? Really? Wait for me!

16:03.630 --> 16:07.000
The teacher told us to take it easy.

16:07.480 --> 16:10.070
I guess we can just relax and kill time.

16:11.820 --> 16:12.820
Akino-san,

16:13.480 --> 16:15.570
will you try skiing down with me?

16:15.570 --> 16:16.300
Huh?

16:16.780 --> 16:18.290
It's just like the game.

16:18.490 --> 16:21.130
We'll figure it out! We just gotta try.

16:24.690 --> 16:28.460
Okay! Class A can spend the 
rest of the time skiing freely.

16:28.460 --> 16:30.030
Okay!

16:28.680 --> 16:30.030
Yay!

16:31.050 --> 16:34.720
Well then, where should I go skiing meow?

16:35.540 --> 16:39.190
Huh? Are those two... No way.

16:39.430 --> 16:41.600
Tsubasa and Sayuri-chan?

16:42.120 --> 16:44.750
Wow! We're so high up, Akino-san!

16:44.750 --> 16:47.780
My legs are dangling over the edge! 
Is this actually safe?!

16:51.130 --> 16:54.820
Wow. The ski resort looks 
huge from this high up.

16:56.560 --> 16:58.180
Hey, Shiki.

16:59.070 --> 17:01.000
Why do you want to ski, Shiki?

17:01.570 --> 17:04.920
The teacher said we 
shouldn't force ourselves.

17:10.210 --> 17:14.510
I've been challenging myself to try 
a bunch of new things in Hokkaido.

17:14.990 --> 17:16.130
Challenge yourself?

17:16.870 --> 17:20.640
Yeah, but the one we're going to 
now is still the easiest course.

17:20.640 --> 17:24.520
Before we went on lunch, 
I asked the teacher for pointers.

17:26.870 --> 17:28.390
You're really something, Shiki.

17:29.030 --> 17:30.870
I could never be like that.

17:30.870 --> 17:35.300
Actually, Fuyuki-san is the 
one who made me decide that.

17:36.390 --> 17:37.330
Fuyuki?

17:37.330 --> 17:41.460
Fuyuki-san is the first friend 
I made since I moved here.

17:41.460 --> 17:46.350
She takes me to eat all sorts of 
things and shows me new places.

17:46.770 --> 17:49.660
Oh, wasn't her skiing today crazy?

17:50.210 --> 17:53.800
Shiki, I can tell you're totally into Fuyuki.

17:53.800 --> 17:57.230
Huh? No, no! It isn't like...

17:57.230 --> 18:00.220
Sh-She's just a normal friend!

18:00.220 --> 18:03.210
If you're gonna try that hard 
to deny it, I must be right.

18:04.780 --> 18:06.690
But I guess Fuyuki is pretty okay then.

18:07.640 --> 18:09.730
I know everyone idolizes her.

18:10.200 --> 18:12.650
She even talks to me sometimes.

18:13.030 --> 18:18.580
But the way I am, I start getting suspicious, 
thinking, "why would she be doing this?"

18:19.010 --> 18:22.000
So I don't know the right way to respond.

18:23.890 --> 18:24.790
But Fuyuki-san is—

18:25.110 --> 18:26.580
We're here. Let's get off.

18:40.420 --> 18:42.730
Akino-san, I have a favor to ask.

18:43.600 --> 18:46.910
If I can make it all the way 
down without falling even once,

18:46.910 --> 18:49.770
I want you to actually respond to Fuyuki-san.

18:50.380 --> 18:52.420
It's not like I was trying to ignore her.

18:52.420 --> 18:57.200
Fuyuki-san truly does want 
to be your friend, Akino-san.

18:57.700 --> 18:59.660
She isn't doing it for any other reason.

19:01.570 --> 19:04.220
You sure like to stick 
your neck out for others.

19:04.220 --> 19:06.320
It isn't only for Fuyuki-san.

19:07.880 --> 19:10.880
I want to become better friends 
with you, too, Akino-san.

19:13.200 --> 19:15.680
F-Fine with me, but on one condition.

19:17.210 --> 19:19.510
Don't you dare leave me behind.

19:21.670 --> 19:24.200
Of course I won't! Let's go together.

19:37.570 --> 19:42.790
<i>The teacher said that to ski slowly, 
keep your center of gravity forward,</i>

19:42.790 --> 19:47.290
<i>point your ski tips together like a wedge, 
and make big, sweeping turns as you go.</i>

19:49.620 --> 19:51.630
I'm actually doing it!

19:57.840 --> 20:01.350
Just a little further. Gotta stay focused.

20:01.910 --> 20:04.180
Make a wedge to slow down...

20:04.740 --> 20:06.560
Oh... ugh!

20:08.210 --> 20:12.560
I-I stopped! I can ski!

20:12.560 --> 20:14.440
Shiki!

20:14.440 --> 20:16.860
How do I stop?!

20:17.660 --> 20:20.950
Oh, crap! I forgot to teach her how to stop!

20:23.030 --> 20:26.370
Akino-san! Make a wedge with your skis!

20:26.370 --> 20:28.220
<i>I don't think she heard me!</i>

20:29.490 --> 20:32.340
<i>I'm going to have to catch her myself!</i>

20:32.980 --> 20:34.330
Sayuri-chan!

20:34.920 --> 20:37.720
If you pull your skis together and 
fall on your butt to one side,

20:37.720 --> 20:40.640
you can stop safely and 
it won't hurt all that much!

20:42.300 --> 20:46.400
Don't worry! The mountain 
rescue gyaru is here for you!

20:47.320 --> 20:49.750
I'll show you what I mean so just copy me!

20:58.720 --> 21:00.760
Are you okay, Sayuri-chan?

21:00.760 --> 21:04.210
I'm fine. It didn't hurt at all.

21:05.050 --> 21:08.580
Akino-san! Fuyuki-san!

21:11.900 --> 21:13.670
Are you guys okay?

21:13.670 --> 21:15.230
Yeah, we're fine.

21:15.780 --> 21:18.080
Oh, good! What a relief!

21:18.080 --> 21:21.060
Hey! Akino, Shiki!

21:21.480 --> 21:22.430
It's the teacher.

21:22.830 --> 21:25.310
Who gave you permission to ski alone?!

21:25.580 --> 21:26.870
I'll go talk to him.

21:26.870 --> 21:27.770
I'll go, too.

21:28.220 --> 21:31.340
No. I made you come with me.

21:31.340 --> 21:34.180
And you almost got injured. I'm really sorry!

21:34.180 --> 21:36.410
I'll accept responsibility 
and take the blame.

21:37.070 --> 21:40.720
Sensei! I'm terribly sorry!

21:40.720 --> 21:44.120
He's apologizing so hard! Hilarious!

21:49.220 --> 21:50.650
Thanks for helping me.

21:51.540 --> 21:54.600
And... sorry for being 
so cold to you until now,

21:57.840 --> 21:58.710
Fuyuki.

22:01.480 --> 22:02.320
Sure!

22:08.900 --> 22:10.110
Is something wrong?

22:10.440 --> 22:11.820
No...

22:11.820 --> 22:17.050
I made friends with Sayuri-chan and had 
fun skiing so it was an amay-and-zing day.

22:17.570 --> 22:21.300
It's just, these two behind 
me are getting way too cozy.

22:21.300 --> 22:28.010
Aww, come on! Why aren't you 
guys hanging out with me more?!
